Package: iBHMM
Title: iBHMM: Bayesian Supervised Biclustering via Hidden Markov Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000 
Authors@R: 
    person("Yuzi", "Mi", , "mi000014@umn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a Bayesian supervised biclustering framework
    using Hidden Markov Models for multi-modality data integration.
    The model performs joint clustering and outcome modeling via
    Gibbs sampling.
